l, --concurrency, custom prompt, and time-to-first-token/inter-token latency metrics."},{"claim_ids":["clm_ef60fa0b7dc535adeaeadb07cc5e3a9f6934d0466c8d381216fc178e0735f5de"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Conversations are automatically saved per-directory, and Octo replaced rolling history windows with autocompaction for long-context tasks to improve prompt cache hit rates."},{"claim_ids":["clm_ff68c6a251949b027b4655a0ce016e1eb70fb9f8df12c525f4a302f0992b75dc"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Docker subcommands exist: 'octo docker connect <container>' attaches to a running container, and 'octo docker run -- <args>' launches a container that shuts down when Octo quits."}],"claim_ids":["clm_0dc8a7d58adfd1cf75c43ef90d9e8bc504bd4636458b46ec6b9d6382f7dac32e","clm_5d406044367d6c19cb86b873658dd2e216bd63b562b32c60e313314d73ffe5f3","clm_5f5a727a0edc02ee8dd327e9fdc33d10a18072ecf0a1e13b4612a0899ec3bcd8","clm_6467f8619faa626f12ac47a1ca6cc73b1d69700690db57388608ff51478c1e00","clm_7844742e6069f28b5fa0671464002eedddfd69a83d1ae9d19a375976dee88a6b","clm_af25437e6a02daac2584ba004d36a0d260936925024e9299ed1296e77036e8a0","clm_db651db9419c97cc6c9acd6e4d6044d802f9a1c736593cf8b6cd53bf11252dbf","clm_ef60fa0b7dc535adeaeadb07cc5e3a9f6934d0466c8d381216fc178e0735f5de","clm_ff68c6a251949b027b4655a0ce016e1eb70fb9f8df12c525f4a302f0992b75dc"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T03:18:07Z","created_by_operation":"op_c78389e918954ff0b6d45e30eaf3f5da","id":"pg_9ace87d7b7925590929e28561271dfeb","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/synthetic-lab-octofriend-changelog-md-6b2159fc9829-28561271dfeb.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_cab459e02f765d4a8d7a7f2fabdc17a8"],"title":"synthetic-lab/octofriend/CHANGELOG.md @ 6b2159fc9829","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:18:07Z","updated_by_operation":"op_c78389e918954ff0b6d45e30eaf3f5da"}
